   "text": "\u2022 the repo is copied in\n\u2022 no internet, no extra privileges\n\u2022 FAKE secrets planted where\n  attackers look: AWS, SSH, GitHub,\n  npm and API keys\n\u2022 new random values every run, so a\n  leak points to one run",
